[statement]
A character device of numbers 1,3 whose `SCHILY.devmajor` and
`SCHILY.devminor` records state the same numbers. Every reader reads 1,3,
and so does ferrotape.

[archive]
pax SCHILY.devmajor=1 SCHILY.devminor=3
header name=c typeflag=3 devmajor=1 devminor=3
header name=after
data "y"
end

